OL,3,GNEWSARecord number of stewards at
OL,4,ANotting Hill Carnival
OL,5,
OL,6,FMore than 3,000 stewards will be on
OL,7,Fduty during this year's Notting Hill
OL,8,FCarnival, double the usual number.
OL,10,FOrganisers say they are using an extra
OL,11,F#4.6m grant from City Hall to bring in
OL,12,Fincreased safety and crowd control
OL,13,Fmeasures for the event - the 60th
OL,14,Fanniversary of the street parade.
OL,16,FAs well as the extra stewarding, there
OL,17,Fwill be more use of specially installed
OL,18,FCCTV cameras along the route, more
OL,19,Fgiant signs to alert carnival-goers to
OL,20,Fpossible hold-ups, and a bigger control
OL,21,Froom to help run the event.
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,325,320,200,140,0,100
