OL,3,GNEWSARecord number of stewards at
OL,4,ANotting Hill Carnival
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Metropolitan Police is also
OL,7,Fexpected to use more live facial
OL,8,Frecognition technology at this year's
OL,9,Fcarnival after deploying two teams last
OL,10,Fyear.
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
